  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Spreading Social Enterprise: training, work and inclusion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the action is to support the sustainable and inclusive development of the Albanian economy, promoting social entrepreneurship and the social re-use of confiscated assets.The specific objective is to strengthen new models of social entrepreneurship and the managerial skills of local CSOs that ensure the socio-economic inclusion of disadvantaged groups, focusing on the social re-use of confiscated assets.</narrative>
  </description>
